WEBVTT

00:00:00.442 --> 00:00:03.057
Demo data: fictional attendee notes in the real conference notebook.

00:00:03.057 --> 00:00:06.968
Open a session and capture its takeaways.

00:00:06.968 --> 00:00:09.691
The draft autosaves through the actual app.

00:00:09.691 --> 00:00:12.363
Offline finalisation stays on the device until connectivity returns.

00:00:12.363 --> 00:00:14.996
Reconnect: the queued response reaches the server.

00:00:14.996 --> 00:00:17.942
Three of three session notes are now finalised.

00:00:17.942 --> 00:00:21.507
Organisers review live participation on the same fictional dataset.

00:00:21.507 --> 00:00:24.293
Search the notes to find follow-up ideas.

00:00:24.293 --> 00:00:27.025
Review an already-completed real Claude analysis of synthetic notes.

00:00:27.025 --> 00:00:29.915
Follow a theme back to the supporting notes.

00:00:29.915 --> 00:00:33.218
Choose the contents of an editable PowerPoint.

00:00:33.218 --> 00:00:35.818
Download the actual generated PowerPoint file.
